IMPORT io
IMPORT source_pkg_tiny

' bug-480 Defect A, the paired half of `source-package-dependency-rt`. Byte for
' byte the same program, against the same `source_pkg_tiny` sources -- the only
' difference is that here the dependency is a compiled `.mfp` rather than a
' source directory. The pair is the assertion: both forms must produce the same
' output, so a signature the source path acquires differently from the `.mfp`
' path shows up as one of the two failing.
FUNC main AS Integer
  io::print(toString(source_pkg_tiny::answer()))
  io::print(source_pkg_tiny::greet("world"))
  RETURN 0
END FUNC
